    new "수익 건에 대해서..."

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:54
    old "I'd like to discuss investing in your company."
    new "당신 회사에 투자하는 건에 대해 이야기하고 싶습니다."

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:55
    old "I'd like to commission a mining expedition."
    new "광산 탐사대를 의뢰하고 싶습니다."

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:57
    old "Nothing for now."
    new "지금은 괜찮습니다."

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:148
    old "Can you explain to me more about these enchantment runes?"
    new "이 마법 강화 룬에 대해 좀 더 설명해 주실 수 있나요?"

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:156
    old "You mentioned you were looking for investors... Could I ask why?"
    new "투자자를 찾고 있다고 하셨는데... 왜인지 물어봐도 될까요?"

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:171
    old "How does a dwarf end up in Hamun starting a mining company?"
    new "드워프가 어쩌다 하문에서 광산 회사를 차리게 되셨나요?"

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:178
    old "That's all for questions for now."
    new "질문은 이걸로 다입니다."

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:216
    old "Here you go."
    new "여기 있습니다."

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:228
    old "I don't have that kind of coin on me right now..."
    new "지금 그만한 돈이 없는데..."

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:265
    old "Ten percent is too low for such high investments on an upstart business with high risks — make it fifteen percent."
    new "위험이 큰 신생 사업에 이런 거금 투자를 하는데 10%는 너무 낙습니다 — 15%로 해주세요."

    # game/data/characters/marbella/dialogue.rpy:272
    old "Sounds good to me."
    new "좋아 보이네요."

